WEBVTT

01:26.510 --> 01:31.550
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.310 --> 01:39.569
[Episode 2: The Three Warriors Meet at Yangzhou]

01:41.070 --> 01:44.520
[15 years ago]

01:42.149 --> 01:45.966
Mother, wake up! Mother!

01:45.990 --> 01:47.520
Mother!

01:47.730 --> 01:50.800
Mother! Mother, wake up!

01:51.560 --> 01:53.010
Mother!

01:53.270 --> 01:56.110
[Luo Family's Village]

02:05.960 --> 02:07.880
Mother!

02:12.080 --> 02:13.376
Wenjia.

02:13.400 --> 02:14.296
Wenjia!

02:14.320 --> 02:15.770
Father!

02:18.990 --> 02:20.440
Hurry...

02:21.180 --> 02:22.700
run.

02:23.280 --> 02:24.760
Run.

02:25.440 --> 02:26.890
Father!

02:29.660 --> 02:30.190
Father!

02:30.210 --> 02:31.476
Kid, come with me.

02:31.500 --> 02:33.046
I'll take you to a safe place.

02:33.070 --> 02:34.870
Wake up.

02:35.790 --> 02:37.240
Father!

02:39.180 --> 02:40.220
Wenjia.

02:39.400 --> 02:42.050
[Yuntai Sect]

02:40.930 --> 02:43.290
This is Yuntai Sect.

02:43.700 --> 02:45.790
Yuntai Sect? I know that.

02:46.350 --> 02:49.570
I heard about it from the village's physiognomist before.

02:50.120 --> 02:51.276
What did he say?

02:51.300 --> 02:53.270
That they are a bunch of liars.

02:54.950 --> 02:56.550
That's quite incisive.

02:57.050 --> 02:59.960
How was Yuntai Sect established?

03:00.200 --> 03:03.430
There's no other way but with wisdom.

03:03.840 --> 03:07.416
Many people can gain money with wisdom.

03:07.440 --> 03:11.320
But only a few can win the country with wisdom.

03:11.650 --> 03:14.486
Legend has it that the highest realm of Qianmen Sect

03:14.510 --> 03:19.359
is to seek for the country in the intangible.

03:20.010 --> 03:22.356
What does the country have to do with me?

03:22.380 --> 03:23.960
I only want the truth.

03:24.280 --> 03:25.786
You just need to tell me

03:25.810 --> 03:28.026
who killed the Luo Family's village's

03:28.050 --> 03:30.156
313 people.

03:30.180 --> 03:31.936
Once you've completed your learning,

03:31.960 --> 03:33.836
I'll make it clear to you.

03:33.860 --> 03:35.806
For now, it's not good for you

03:35.830 --> 03:37.350
to know too much.

03:38.770 --> 03:41.620
How long will the learning take, according to Qianmen Sect's rules?

03:41.910 --> 03:43.966
Qianmen Sect is of the past.

03:43.990 --> 03:45.670
We only talk about Yuntai Sect.

03:45.940 --> 03:47.890
Then according to Yuntai Sect's rules.

03:49.200 --> 03:50.756
For those with ordinary qualifications,

03:50.780 --> 03:52.736
it takes three to five years.

03:52.760 --> 03:56.440
It's a different matter if he's exceptionally talented.

03:56.630 --> 03:58.440
It only takes three to five years?

03:58.570 --> 03:59.656
Okay.

03:59.680 --> 04:01.360
After I've completed my learning,

04:01.420 --> 04:03.136
you have to tell me the truth.

04:03.160 --> 04:08.220
From now on, Luo Wenjia no longer exists in the world.

04:09.050 --> 04:10.500
You are...

04:11.370 --> 04:13.020
Yun Xiang.

04:28.780 --> 04:31.290
[Baiju Town]

04:32.600 --> 04:33.996
Everyone, get up!

04:34.020 --> 04:35.236
Get up now!

04:35.260 --> 04:37.326
Get up! Get up! Time to work!

04:37.350 --> 04:40.590
Get up now! Everyone, get up!

04:41.190 --> 04:42.586
No more lying down, get up!

04:42.610 --> 04:43.926
Time to work!

04:43.950 --> 04:45.400
Don't slack off!

04:49.910 --> 04:51.360
Hurry up.

04:51.890 --> 04:52.896
Hurry!

04:52.920 --> 04:54.680
What are you looking at? Go!

04:56.299 --> 04:57.749
Hurry up!

04:59.500 --> 05:00.950
Follow me.

05:05.430 --> 05:06.846
I asked you to give me your hand!

05:06.870 --> 05:08.320
Behave yourself!

05:09.100 --> 05:10.550
Go!

05:13.680 --> 05:15.130
Hurry, go!

05:18.100 --> 05:19.550
Hurry!

05:36.820 --> 05:39.200
There's a dead rat here. It stinks.

05:40.000 --> 05:41.060
I'll break your leg too,

05:41.080 --> 05:42.286
and lock you up here for another ten days.

05:42.310 --> 05:43.830
Then you won't ask that anymore.

05:45.080 --> 05:46.800
Both legs broken.

05:47.170 --> 05:48.620
Hurry, go!

06:00.190 --> 06:01.696
Everyone, listen up!

06:01.720 --> 06:03.876
You can pair up freely.

06:03.900 --> 06:05.626
Work hard!

06:05.650 --> 06:07.106
No one is allowed to slack off!

06:07.130 --> 06:08.136
Otherwise,

06:08.160 --> 06:10.266
you'll be whipped.

06:10.290 --> 06:12.500
All right, get back to work!

06:31.720 --> 06:33.166
Kid,

06:33.190 --> 06:36.116
I'll personally whip you today.

06:36.140 --> 06:37.576
Do you dare?

06:37.600 --> 06:39.200
You rotten Baldy.

06:39.450 --> 06:40.900
You...

06:53.910 --> 06:55.596
You're making trouble here again.

06:55.620 --> 06:57.900
You'll have to do twice the workload today!

06:58.460 --> 06:59.396
What's wrong?

06:59.420 --> 07:01.096
I'm afraid something happened to my bone.

07:01.120 --> 07:01.706
Take him away!

07:01.730 --> 07:03.180
Yes.

07:06.570 --> 07:08.540
Hurry up. What are you looking at?

07:14.780 --> 07:16.230
Hurry up.

07:22.680 --> 07:24.930
Can you find me an orthopedic doctor?

07:26.500 --> 07:27.806
Doctor?

07:27.830 --> 07:29.306
Just stay here rotting

07:29.330 --> 07:31.340
and wait for your death.

07:31.890 --> 07:33.890
You'll also suffer from the odor of my corpse if I die!

07:34.120 --> 07:35.570
Hey!

07:48.500 --> 07:49.950
Mr. Wen.

07:52.320 --> 07:53.770
Mr. Wen?

07:57.630 --> 07:59.520
Who is it?

07:59.549 --> 08:01.000
I'm Yun Xiang.

08:01.210 --> 08:02.736
I've completed my learning.

08:02.760 --> 08:04.256
I was going to visit you in Nandu,

08:04.280 --> 08:06.720
but halfway through my journey, I heard you got into trouble.

08:06.830 --> 08:08.976
Yun Xiang.

08:09.000 --> 08:10.450
Mr. Wen.

08:10.610 --> 08:13.010
Do you remember what you promised me?

08:27.770 --> 08:29.890
I heard you were bullied.

08:33.750 --> 08:35.200
Does it hurt?

08:35.840 --> 08:36.415
Yes!

08:36.439 --> 08:38.886
Is the female cat burglar who ran away from the gambling house that day

08:38.910 --> 08:40.819
in cahoots with you?

08:40.929 --> 08:42.226
Where is she?

08:42.250 --> 08:43.970
I don't know that woman.

08:44.650 --> 08:45.596
Think about it.

08:45.620 --> 08:46.836
If I were in cahoots with her,

08:46.860 --> 08:48.936
how could she be living a carefree life

08:48.960 --> 08:51.220
while I'm being tortured here?

08:51.470 --> 08:54.790
Guess if I believe you.

09:02.300 --> 09:03.810
I'll give it to you, fellow.

09:03.940 --> 09:05.840
You're quite tolerant.

09:05.920 --> 09:09.020
Let’s see how long you can last.

09:09.580 --> 09:11.030
Lord Yan.

09:24.170 --> 09:28.560
[Yangzhou City]

09:33.320 --> 09:34.706
Travel permit!

09:34.280 --> 09:35.990
[Travel Permit]

09:36.410 --> 09:37.860
Okay, go.

09:50.360 --> 09:51.810
Hurry up.

09:58.430 --> 09:59.156
You!

09:59.180 --> 10:01.090
Stay here and behave yourself.

10:19.440 --> 10:20.890
Senior.

10:23.340 --> 10:24.790
Senior.

10:25.260 --> 10:27.246
Your arm injury...

10:27.270 --> 10:29.566
is self-inflicted.

10:29.590 --> 10:31.100
If not,

10:31.360 --> 10:33.350
how could I be alone with you?

10:36.300 --> 10:39.020
Why are you going to such great lengths

10:39.330 --> 10:42.196
for a useless person like me?

10:42.220 --> 10:44.876
If you hadn't saved me 15 years ago

10:44.900 --> 10:46.770
and sent me to the Master,

10:47.210 --> 10:49.400
I don't know what would have become of me.

10:49.960 --> 10:52.250
I might have already died.

10:53.330 --> 10:54.960
Now that you're in trouble,

10:55.230 --> 10:56.980
how can I stand by and watch?

10:57.450 --> 10:59.520
I've come up with a perfect plan.

10:59.730 --> 11:01.570
Now we only need the right opportunity.

11:02.680 --> 11:04.530
No need.

11:04.720 --> 11:08.080
Who is it that wants to harm you?

11:08.320 --> 11:14.196
Last month, the government investigated me

11:14.220 --> 11:16.260
in the name of fraud.

11:16.360 --> 11:20.340
He was the one who snitched.

11:22.350 --> 11:25.896
He must be afraid of your revenge,

11:25.920 --> 11:27.456
so he bribed the soldiers

11:27.480 --> 11:29.926
to send you to this remote place in Baiju Town

11:29.950 --> 11:31.720
and handed you to the corrupt officials.

11:32.230 --> 11:33.870
What's his name?

11:35.430 --> 11:41.376
Qi Tianfeng, the sect leader of Cao Sect.

11:40.950 --> 11:47.160
[Cao Sect of Nandu]

12:10.470 --> 12:14.070
[Qi Tianfeng, Sect Leader of Cao Sect]

12:12.220 --> 12:14.100
Your Master!

12:15.530 --> 12:16.980
Something happened.

12:31.140 --> 12:32.990
What’s with the panic?

12:33.610 --> 12:34.860
I heard that someone pasted the secret accounts

12:34.880 --> 12:36.680
of Yan Luowang's salt trafficking

12:36.720 --> 12:38.840
at the entrance of the Yangzhou prefecture.

12:39.240 --> 12:40.696
This is weird.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.466
Just a few days ago, I saw that secret account book

12:42.490 --> 12:44.070
when I was checking the account balance with him.

12:43.430 --> 12:44.926
[Yangzhou Prefecture Office]

12:44.500 --> 12:46.436
Baiju Town is under the jurisdiction

12:46.460 --> 12:48.186
and direct management of the Yangzhou prefecture.

12:48.210 --> 12:50.296
It seems to be targeting Yan Luowang.

12:50.320 --> 12:51.536
If we keep investigating,

12:51.560 --> 12:54.050
I'm afraid more trouble will ensue.

12:59.910 --> 13:01.950
Although the fish intestine is not fatal,

13:02.660 --> 13:05.150
it's connected to all the internal organs.

13:05.410 --> 13:09.580
It has to be completely removed to prevent future trouble.

13:12.830 --> 13:15.460
The brightest part of all animals

13:15.820 --> 13:17.470
are the eyes.

13:18.290 --> 13:20.426
And the pufferfish's eyes

13:20.450 --> 13:22.260
are precisely the most poisonous part.

13:22.940 --> 13:25.580
So we must be careful to remove them completely.

13:30.700 --> 13:32.480
Your Master, are you referring to...

13:33.050 --> 13:34.500
Wen Cong?

13:38.620 --> 13:40.070
Try it.

13:40.320 --> 13:45.656
Right now, you have to run away quickly

13:45.680 --> 13:49.210
and settle down safely.

13:51.110 --> 13:52.560
Senior.

13:53.470 --> 13:55.400
Do you remember Shu Yanan?

13:57.840 --> 13:59.176
My lord.

13:59.200 --> 14:00.920
Have you found the girl?

14:02.470 --> 14:03.826
By the west wharf,

14:03.850 --> 14:05.236
wild dogs have dug up many corpses.

14:05.260 --> 14:06.780
It's Li and the others.

14:08.990 --> 14:10.056
Follow me.

14:10.080 --> 14:11.530
Yes.

14:28.180 --> 14:29.216
Wen Cong.

14:29.240 --> 14:31.856
My people were killed for no reason.

14:31.880 --> 14:33.400
Did you deliver the news outwards

14:33.400 --> 14:35.276
such that your disciples came to me?

14:35.300 --> 14:38.060
I'm imprisoned in this dungeon.

14:38.270 --> 14:41.150
How can I deliver the message?

14:41.870 --> 14:43.526
Stop playing tricks.

14:43.550 --> 14:46.070
Qi Tianfeng only told me to keep an eye on you,

14:46.210 --> 14:49.576
but he didn't tell me to keep you alive.

14:49.600 --> 14:51.050
Lord Yan!

14:51.960 --> 14:52.816
My lord.

14:52.840 --> 14:53.946
Speak!

14:53.970 --> 14:55.296
All of your secret accounts

14:55.320 --> 14:57.760
were pasted at the entrance of the Yangzhou prefecture.

15:02.260 --> 15:03.046
Tell me!

15:03.070 --> 15:05.020
Was it you?

15:06.960 --> 15:08.740
Lord Yan.

15:09.600 --> 15:11.740
You two colluded

15:11.760 --> 15:13.626
and embezzled the government's salt.

15:13.650 --> 15:15.826
Once this news spreads,

15:15.850 --> 15:19.260
you know what the consequences will be like.

15:20.170 --> 15:22.596
If you offend Qi Tianfeng,

15:22.620 --> 15:24.966
you still have places to hide.

15:24.990 --> 15:27.586
But if you offend Yuntai Sect,

15:27.610 --> 15:29.916
there will be no place for you

15:29.940 --> 15:34.110
in this world anymore.

15:35.540 --> 15:36.990
Let's go.

15:37.060 --> 15:38.510
Go!

15:41.600 --> 15:42.296
Lock the door well.

15:42.320 --> 15:43.770
Yes.

15:45.330 --> 15:46.096
My lord,

15:46.120 --> 15:47.326
we can't stay in Baiju Town.

15:47.350 --> 15:48.806
Hurry and pack your things.

15:48.830 --> 15:50.280
Okay.

15:56.690 --> 15:58.610
[Zhang Kui, Cao Sect]

16:01.760 --> 16:03.966
Zhang Kui, what's the meaning of this?

16:03.990 --> 16:05.046
Lord Yan,

16:05.070 --> 16:07.456
Master Qi has set up a tomb for you.

16:07.480 --> 16:10.160
I’ll personally send you in.

16:24.600 --> 16:26.050
Lord Yan,

16:26.300 --> 16:28.550
the sooner you die, the sooner you'll be reincarnated.

16:52.470 --> 16:53.920
Stop chasing.

16:53.980 --> 16:56.186
The most important thing now is to destroy the salt farm's official accounts.

16:56.210 --> 16:56.926
Go.

16:56.950 --> 16:58.766
Light the fire while the wind is blowing.

16:58.790 --> 17:00.066
Light the fire in more spots,

17:00.090 --> 17:02.606
so we don't raise suspicions about how only the accounting office caught fire.

17:02.630 --> 17:02.930
Yes.

17:02.950 --> 17:04.400
Yes.

17:50.470 --> 17:51.866
Make it quick!

17:51.890 --> 17:53.206
Go report to the government yourself.

17:53.230 --> 17:54.436
I want you to pay

17:54.460 --> 17:56.960
for Godfather's suffering bit by bit.

18:10.740 --> 18:12.220
You asked for your death.

18:13.460 --> 18:15.950
Fire! Run!

18:17.680 --> 18:19.130
Hurry!

18:26.670 --> 18:28.170
Fire!

19:10.930 --> 19:12.970
Did you set the fire?

19:15.900 --> 19:17.350
Yes...

19:17.430 --> 19:18.880
or no.

19:19.090 --> 19:22.486
You disclosed Yan Luowang’s salt trafficking

19:22.510 --> 19:24.526
and made him panic.

19:24.550 --> 19:27.220
If he wants to completely destroy the evidence,

19:27.360 --> 19:29.866
he needs to destroy the official accounts.

19:29.890 --> 19:32.266
Soon, the fire will spread with the sea breeze.

19:32.290 --> 19:34.080
Baiju Town will be in chaos.

19:34.230 --> 19:35.816
This is our chance to escape.

19:35.840 --> 19:39.656
You've indeed learned your deduction skills from our Sect's teachings.

19:39.680 --> 19:41.576
But in order to save me,

19:41.600 --> 19:44.386
you've put Baiju Town's people in calamity.

19:44.410 --> 19:46.456
Is this the way of Yuntai Sect?

19:46.480 --> 19:47.846
If we don't get rid of Yan Luowang,

19:47.870 --> 19:49.840
how can the salt workers and salt businesses make a comeback?

19:50.470 --> 19:51.726
I just hope this big fire

19:51.750 --> 19:53.526
can burn down the injustice of the past.

19:53.550 --> 19:55.220
Only in this way can the whole Baiju Town

19:55.460 --> 19:58.040
have a chance to start anew.

20:01.150 --> 20:02.730
The members of Yuntai Sect

20:04.030 --> 20:05.480
win and stay upright

20:05.520 --> 20:06.970
with wisdom.

20:08.750 --> 20:10.600
Although you've broken both your legs,

20:10.960 --> 20:13.130
you can still despise me.

20:14.310 --> 20:15.676
I've been waiting for 15 years

20:15.700 --> 20:16.766
just for today.

20:16.790 --> 20:18.886
You've learned for 15 years.

20:18.910 --> 20:20.506
How much have you had figured out?

20:20.530 --> 20:23.256
Senior, what exactly happened in Luo Family's village that year?

20:23.280 --> 20:25.946
I was the one who ordered Qi Tianfeng to bribe the soldiers.

20:25.970 --> 20:28.786
They entered the Luo Family's village in the name of investigating pirates

20:28.810 --> 20:31.016
and forced the farmers to hand over their land.

20:31.040 --> 20:33.120
However, I didn't expect the soldiers to slaughter

20:33.120 --> 20:34.426
and massacre the entire village.

20:34.450 --> 20:35.656
When I arrived,

20:35.680 --> 20:38.160
I only had time to save you.

20:39.310 --> 20:41.080
The soldiers massacred my family's village.

20:41.630 --> 20:44.646
Who else is behind this?

20:44.670 --> 20:47.016
The truth you've been waiting for 15 years

20:47.040 --> 20:49.006
turned out to be worse than you imagined.

20:49.030 --> 20:51.656
Enmity is of the mortal heart.

20:51.680 --> 20:54.316
A mortal heart cannot master the way of Yuntai Sect.

20:54.340 --> 20:57.336
Yun Xiang, are you still unable to let it go?

20:57.360 --> 20:59.436
Do you still want to investigate the case?

20:59.460 --> 21:00.910
My surname is Luo.

21:02.290 --> 21:03.830
My name is Luo Wenjia.

21:04.950 --> 21:07.270
You are extremely talented.

21:07.530 --> 21:10.500
If you can let go of the past—

21:30.600 --> 21:33.510
Put me down and run!

22:33.030 --> 22:34.026
Mr. Wen.

22:34.050 --> 22:35.500
Don't bother about me.

22:35.880 --> 22:37.650
Run!

22:58.480 --> 23:00.110
Yanan...

23:01.990 --> 23:04.160
Take care of her.

23:11.900 --> 23:13.350
Mr. Wen!

24:04.410 --> 24:07.920
What did Godfather say before he died?

24:08.930 --> 24:10.450
He said nothing.

24:14.380 --> 24:16.060
Godfather, I'm sorry I couldn't fulfill my filial duties.

24:16.610 --> 24:18.060
I was late.

24:19.200 --> 24:20.760
As gratitude for raising me,

24:22.760 --> 24:24.440
I swear I'll repay you with the blood of your enemy.

24:27.200 --> 24:30.970
An eye for an eye.

24:31.750 --> 24:33.430
New and old hatred...

24:35.430 --> 24:36.990
when will they end?

24:41.200 --> 24:43.790
If you were young and homeless,

24:46.170 --> 24:48.576
and had to face the tragic death of your benefactor

24:48.600 --> 24:50.340
who was also like family,

24:51.640 --> 24:53.840
your hatred would be greater than mine.

25:17.110 --> 25:18.830
Don’t be too sad.

25:20.280 --> 25:21.896
If Mr. Wen was alive,

25:21.920 --> 25:23.760
he wouldn’t want to see you like this.

25:37.040 --> 25:41.860
The fire has burnt out and only ashes are left.

25:44.810 --> 25:46.710
It seems like only ashes are left,

25:48.180 --> 25:50.310
but they're actually marking another beginning.

25:54.420 --> 25:56.160
The entire area along the river

25:56.500 --> 25:58.970
is now under Qi Tianfeng's control.

25:59.380 --> 26:01.330
Have you thought about what to do next?

26:02.800 --> 26:04.250
Not yet.

26:06.100 --> 26:07.630
Speaking of which, it's absurd,

26:08.640 --> 26:10.730
that I know nothing about you.

26:13.220 --> 26:14.876
Actually, there's also a deep grudge...

26:14.900 --> 26:16.606
I've to settle between Qi Tianfeng and me.

26:16.630 --> 26:17.686
How about this?

26:17.710 --> 26:19.516
Why don't you join hands with me?

26:19.540 --> 26:20.816
Think about it.

26:20.840 --> 26:23.676
If you are alone,

26:23.700 --> 26:25.226
your power is limited.

26:25.250 --> 26:26.820
If we work together,

26:27.140 --> 26:29.950
with my wisdom and your martial arts skills,

26:30.150 --> 26:32.880
we make up for each other's shortcomings, like a perfect match.

26:35.760 --> 26:38.040
Why do I feel like you've planned this beforehand?

26:40.940 --> 26:42.580
Sort of.

26:43.350 --> 26:44.800
Let's go.

26:44.830 --> 26:45.776
Where are we going?

26:45.800 --> 26:47.250
Yangzhou.

26:48.440 --> 26:51.020
Yangzhou is the biggest commercial port north of Yangtze River.

26:51.080 --> 26:53.040
There are Cao Sect's spies everywhere.

26:53.560 --> 26:55.010
Let's go.

26:59.860 --> 27:02.850
[Drunken Willow Inn]

27:10.460 --> 27:11.910
Warrior Jin.

27:12.040 --> 27:14.296
It's the same price as an Armed Escort's life.

27:14.320 --> 27:16.476
Ten taels of gold per life.

27:16.500 --> 27:17.536
No problem.

27:17.560 --> 27:19.176
I want him killed even if I have to borrow money.

27:19.200 --> 27:20.246
I wasn't home for months

27:20.270 --> 27:22.846
and that shrew actually fell in love with the neighboring village's butcher.

27:22.870 --> 27:23.736
I offer 20 taels.

27:23.760 --> 27:26.026
Please help me kill these adulterers.

27:26.050 --> 27:28.290
I don't kill women and children.

27:28.530 --> 27:30.306
If she's with the butcher now,

27:30.330 --> 27:31.776
why can't you just marry another woman?

27:31.800 --> 27:33.250
This...

27:38.710 --> 27:39.736
Jin Biao.

27:39.760 --> 27:41.356
There's a reckless kid in the West Village

27:41.380 --> 27:43.066
who is recklessly targeting the County Magistrate

27:43.090 --> 27:43.866
for owing some workers' wages.

27:43.890 --> 27:45.226
The County Magistrate wants to invite you over.

27:45.250 --> 27:46.286
As long as no one finds out,

27:46.310 --> 27:47.760
we can negotiate the price.

27:50.900 --> 27:54.020
[Swordsman, "Ten Taels of Gold"]

27:54.560 --> 27:56.170
What a corrupt official.

27:56.270 --> 27:57.886
He doesn't want to pay wages,

27:57.910 --> 28:00.096
but is willing to pay to have someone killed.

28:00.120 --> 28:01.246
Get lost.

28:01.270 --> 28:02.346
Sorry, Warrior Jin.

28:02.370 --> 28:03.536
Goodbye.

28:03.560 --> 28:06.170
Jin Biao, "Ten Taels of Gold".

28:08.160 --> 28:10.666
Twenty taels for him dead.

28:10.690 --> 28:12.210
Let me have a look at him.

28:18.380 --> 28:19.830
I can't accept this deal.

28:19.870 --> 28:21.350
If it's too low,

28:21.410 --> 28:23.000
just name the price.

28:23.960 --> 28:25.410
You're too late.

28:25.750 --> 28:27.670
He just hired me.

28:27.770 --> 28:29.366
I need to do something.

28:29.390 --> 28:30.840
Thirty taels.

28:31.130 --> 28:32.580
Forty taels.

28:36.020 --> 28:37.470
Fifty taels?

28:38.630 --> 28:40.216
How many times do I have to tell you?

28:40.240 --> 28:41.456
Get lost!

28:41.480 --> 28:43.320
Don't overestimate yourself.

28:59.590 --> 29:01.466
My business is priced at 10 taels of gold per life.

29:01.490 --> 29:03.440
Do you know what it's based on?

29:03.730 --> 29:06.296
First, I keep my promise.

29:06.320 --> 29:07.770
Second...

29:15.340 --> 29:16.790
I'm quick.

29:19.880 --> 29:21.480
Two lives.

29:22.310 --> 29:23.760
Twenty taels.

29:43.890 --> 29:46.040
You tried so hard to save Godfather.

29:46.900 --> 29:48.350
Yet you're not at all sad

29:48.440 --> 29:50.340
over his death.

29:51.310 --> 29:53.910
Why cry over spilt milk?

29:55.350 --> 29:56.766
By the way,

29:56.790 --> 29:58.146
how much do you know

29:58.170 --> 29:59.800
about Qi Tianfeng?

30:01.230 --> 30:03.446
I only know that he's from Cao Sect.

30:03.470 --> 30:05.320
He used to be a wharf laborer,

30:05.670 --> 30:08.230
but he was ruthless and decisive.

30:08.460 --> 30:10.940
Back then, Godfather broke into the commerce world of Nandu

30:10.980 --> 30:12.456
and caused a stir among the local forces.

30:12.480 --> 30:14.236
He needed someone to appear in public for him

30:14.260 --> 30:16.036
and chose Qi Tianfeng.

30:16.060 --> 30:17.386
In return,

30:17.410 --> 30:18.580
Godfather helped him secure the position

30:18.600 --> 30:20.496
of the Sect leader of Cao Sect.

30:20.520 --> 30:21.970
Have you seen him before?

30:22.460 --> 30:24.110
A long time ago.

30:24.910 --> 30:26.476
He looks weak,

30:26.500 --> 30:29.396
but he's actually a martial arts expert in Nandu City.

30:29.420 --> 30:33.056
And he went straight up to a prestigious official position from such a humble one.

30:33.080 --> 30:36.040
It's unfathomable how scheming he is.

30:37.710 --> 30:40.040
Qi Tianfeng and Mr. Wen were so close.

30:40.440 --> 30:42.150
As his goddaughter,

30:42.250 --> 30:43.900
you should have seen him often.

30:47.750 --> 30:50.070
If I had known Cao Sect was after you,

30:50.210 --> 30:52.020
I would have asked for more than 10 taels.

30:52.510 --> 30:53.990
Did they look for you?

30:54.430 --> 30:55.880
He offered

30:55.960 --> 30:57.550
20 taels of gold.

30:58.480 --> 31:00.050
Do you think I accepted it?

31:13.120 --> 31:15.030
From what you've just said, I don't think

31:15.830 --> 31:18.510
you have the intention to kill me.

31:25.200 --> 31:26.700
Of course.

31:28.120 --> 31:30.080
There are rules in my industry.

31:30.350 --> 31:32.096
But they kept insisting me to do it.

31:32.120 --> 31:33.760
So I warned them

31:34.230 --> 31:35.890
by killing two of them.

31:36.880 --> 31:37.776
Do you want more money?

31:37.800 --> 31:40.000
I like you, so I'll give you a 50% discount.

31:43.930 --> 31:45.610
Please spare your effort.

31:46.100 --> 31:48.390
If you kill all your way to Nandu,

31:48.550 --> 31:50.300
I'll go bankrupt.

31:57.260 --> 31:59.140
Miss, you said your back hurt just now.

32:11.440 --> 32:12.686
Look at you.

32:12.710 --> 32:15.180
You want to cross the river yet you offended Cao Sect.

32:15.280 --> 32:17.190
This river belongs to them.

32:17.920 --> 32:19.246
I reckon you already had a plan.

32:19.270 --> 32:20.720
Speak up.

32:21.750 --> 32:23.780
Miss, are you familiar with Yangzhou?

32:24.570 --> 32:26.456
In terms of prosperity along the river,

32:26.480 --> 32:28.960
Nandu comes in first and Yangzhou comes in second.

32:29.300 --> 32:30.756
The two cities divide the country into the South and the North.

32:30.780 --> 32:32.230
Facing each other from afar,

32:32.260 --> 32:35.150
both are hubs frequented by groups of traveling merchants.

32:37.210 --> 32:38.976
You crossed the river from Yangzhou

32:39.000 --> 32:40.626
because you want to set up a group of traveling merchants,

32:40.650 --> 32:42.276
so it'll be harder for the opponents

32:42.300 --> 32:43.966
to attack you in public.

32:43.990 --> 32:46.710
The biggest raw silk market in Yangzhou is ahead,

32:46.830 --> 32:48.560
filled with groups of traveling merchants from Nandu.

32:54.150 --> 32:57.560
With such a brain, your head is valuable.

33:06.250 --> 33:08.010
[Yunjin Silk Shop]

33:08.030 --> 33:10.460
[Su]

33:12.430 --> 33:13.000
Mr. Su.

33:13.020 --> 33:14.026
Mr. Su.

33:14.050 --> 33:15.930
Mr. Su, look at mine.

33:24.940 --> 33:26.860
He's from the Su family of Nandu.

33:29.280 --> 33:31.966
The Su family of Nandu is the leader of the commerce world

33:31.990 --> 33:33.576
as the century-old royal supplier of silk.

33:33.600 --> 33:35.426
These rich merchants are the most cautious.

33:35.450 --> 33:37.070
How can we get them involved?

33:42.950 --> 33:43.896
I pick you.

33:43.920 --> 33:44.520
Thank you, Mr. Su.

33:44.520 --> 33:44.940
Mr. Su.

33:44.960 --> 33:46.410
Thank you, Mr. Su.

33:46.880 --> 33:47.460
Mr. Su.

33:47.480 --> 33:49.280
Mr. Su, please take a good look at mine again.

33:48.090 --> 33:50.830
[Su Mingyu, the Su Family of Nandu]

33:51.380 --> 33:55.160
[Qian Rong, Steward of the Su Family]

33:51.750 --> 33:54.510
There are still many raw silk businesses.

33:54.600 --> 33:56.320
It won't hurt to check out a few more.

33:58.120 --> 33:59.776
They are all raw silk from Yangzhou.

33:59.800 --> 34:01.280
I don't think there will be any difference.

34:01.680 --> 34:03.496
In business, it's better to

34:03.520 --> 34:04.786
be more meticulous.

34:04.810 --> 34:05.806
Qian.

34:05.830 --> 34:08.105
Our family goes to Yangzhou to purchase raw silk every year.

34:08.129 --> 34:10.605
We have a friendly relationship with these silk merchants.

34:10.629 --> 34:12.096
The martial world is about chivalry.

34:12.120 --> 34:13.736
There's no need to nitpick.

34:13.760 --> 34:15.210
Young Master,

34:15.279 --> 34:16.696
this isn't the martial world,

34:16.720 --> 34:18.170
but the commerce world.

34:18.589 --> 34:20.060
My sister said

34:20.170 --> 34:22.736
I have the say on this silk purchase.

34:22.760 --> 34:25.036
It is said that the Young Master of the Su family is chivalrous and brave.

34:25.060 --> 34:26.196
It’s an honor to meet you today.

34:26.220 --> 34:27.656
I really admire you.

34:27.680 --> 34:29.315
Since Mr. Su is so chivalrous,

34:29.339 --> 34:31.366
I'll sell my 500 catties of fine raw silk

34:31.390 --> 34:33.616
to you at its base price.

34:33.640 --> 34:34.696
This 500 catties—

34:34.720 --> 34:36.170
Thank you, then.

34:36.260 --> 34:37.710
Young Master.

34:37.910 --> 34:39.630
Purchasing 500 catties at a time

34:39.700 --> 34:41.126
is not in accordance with Su family's rules.

34:41.150 --> 34:42.416
Rules are set by people.

34:42.440 --> 34:43.726
In the future, if I were to take the helm

34:43.750 --> 34:45.470
and change all the rules—

34:45.540 --> 34:47.650
If this deal is done,

34:48.490 --> 34:50.116
you'll not only break the rules,

34:50.140 --> 34:51.656
but also lose the favor of the people.

34:51.680 --> 34:54.519
Who are you? And why do you say that?

34:58.500 --> 34:59.876
Mr. Su.

34:59.900 --> 35:02.396
You accept medium-quality silk at the price of high-quality silk.

35:02.420 --> 35:04.390
This goes against the rules of commerce.

35:04.520 --> 35:06.760
Readily believing those smooth talkers

35:06.790 --> 35:09.830
will only disappoint the meticulous silk merchants.

35:09.910 --> 35:12.346
The natural way of commerce is to retain by fair means what was acquired by foul.

35:12.370 --> 35:14.306
No matter how big your family or business is,

35:14.330 --> 35:16.206
if your words and actions are this rash,

35:16.230 --> 35:18.986
I’m afraid your reputation as the royal supplier won’t last much longer.

35:19.010 --> 35:20.816
My family is the century-old royal supplier of silk.

35:20.840 --> 35:22.706
I know how to discern good silk from bad ones.

35:22.730 --> 35:24.540
Who are you to interfere?

35:26.760 --> 35:28.246
In that case,

35:28.270 --> 35:30.490
you must have done that intentionally.

35:36.860 --> 35:38.460
I was too impatient just now.

35:38.710 --> 35:39.896
Why don't we take another look?

35:39.920 --> 35:40.976
Next.

35:41.000 --> 35:41.906
Mr. Su,

35:41.930 --> 35:43.806
we just agreed...

35:43.830 --> 35:46.150
Do you still want to do business with the Su family in the future?

35:46.560 --> 35:49.080
Okay then. Mr. Su, take your time to look around.

35:51.280 --> 35:51.966
Young Master, a moment please.

35:51.990 --> 35:52.906
Qian.

35:52.930 --> 35:54.380
Who cares about him?

35:55.740 --> 35:58.900
You seem extraordinary and proficient in commerce.

35:59.060 --> 36:00.456
Which family in Yangzhou City

36:00.480 --> 36:02.360
do you belong to?

36:02.430 --> 36:03.416
I'm just passing by Yangzhou

36:03.440 --> 36:04.956
on my way to Nandu.

36:04.980 --> 36:06.246
You're going to Nandu?

36:06.270 --> 36:08.566
That's great, you should come with us.

36:08.590 --> 36:10.760
Let's go together.

36:19.100 --> 36:20.550
I'm sorry.

36:22.320 --> 36:23.496
Sure.

36:23.520 --> 36:24.386
I happen to have two friends with me.

36:24.410 --> 36:25.336
Can they join us too?

36:25.360 --> 36:27.680
Since they're your friends, of course.

36:44.320 --> 36:46.160
This journey is boring.

36:46.200 --> 36:47.716
I haven't even seen a thief.

36:47.740 --> 36:49.760
It's good to have a safe journey.

36:50.050 --> 36:51.356
We are businessmen,

36:51.380 --> 36:52.986
not people of the martial world.

36:53.010 --> 36:54.516
You are the only son of the Su family.

36:54.540 --> 36:56.660
You’ve to take over the family business sooner or later.

36:56.740 --> 36:59.566
It’s good to know more about the raw silk industry

36:59.590 --> 37:00.776
prior.

37:00.800 --> 37:02.846
It's more practical than looking for

37:02.870 --> 37:03.476
those martial arts books.

37:03.500 --> 37:05.710
I know, Qian.

37:22.150 --> 37:24.430
What's your relationship with Cao Sect?

37:30.900 --> 37:33.360
I have a grudge against Qi Tianfeng for exterminating my family.

37:35.180 --> 37:36.780
More than 10 years ago,

37:37.510 --> 37:39.990
Shu family's Armed Escort Agency took a business deal.

37:40.570 --> 37:43.030
The Armed Escort's capital was a whopping 300 taels of gold.

37:43.500 --> 37:46.020
Naturally, the security deposit was also high.

37:43.670 --> 37:48.180
[More than 10 years ago]

37:46.160 --> 37:47.296
If anything went wrong,

37:47.320 --> 37:50.240
Shu's Chief Armed Escort would go bankrupt.

37:51.930 --> 37:53.770
In the end, he ran into pirates.

37:55.770 --> 37:57.260
[Shu's Ancestral Hall]

37:56.650 --> 37:59.126
Three generations of Shu family's property was destroyed in one go.

37:59.150 --> 38:01.320
My father committed suicide in resentment.

38:02.590 --> 38:06.300
Qi Tianfeng was the one who offered this business deal.

38:08.360 --> 38:09.810
I see.

38:09.850 --> 38:11.176
In just this one round,

38:11.200 --> 38:13.336
Qi Tianfeng usurped all of Shu family's property.

38:13.360 --> 38:14.756
I'm guessing he must have already been in contact

38:14.780 --> 38:16.340
with those pirates beforehand.

38:17.280 --> 38:18.836
After my father died,

38:18.860 --> 38:20.590
Qi Tianfeng wanted to get rid of every member of the Shu family

38:20.610 --> 38:22.270
to eliminate all future troubles.

38:22.770 --> 38:24.130
It was Mr. Wen who saved me

38:24.150 --> 38:25.980
and took me in as his goddaughter.

38:26.270 --> 38:29.796
After I became an adult, I traveled around and practiced martial arts.

38:29.820 --> 38:32.910
I only found out Godfather was in trouble when I returned to Nandu half a month ago.

38:34.680 --> 38:36.240
But it was still too late.

38:37.410 --> 38:40.100
No wonder you said you haven't seen Qi Tianfeng in a long time.

38:40.280 --> 38:41.796
With his power today,

38:41.820 --> 38:43.696
he must be much stronger than before.

38:43.720 --> 38:45.360
How sure are you that you can take him down?

38:45.430 --> 38:47.170
Let's just go to Nandu first.
